      "addons_prompt_limits": "The HypeRate Desktop addon in this folder runs into limits of the app: {dir}\nFirst read AGENTS.md in that folder, above all \"What is not possible (yet)\" and \"When something the user wants is not possible\", and adapt the addon. Write what is missing into WISHES.md.\nWhat happened:\n{task}",
